#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:5
#: 1062b84a12d6499c98d74c9b859d8d36
msgid "Passing Serial over DroneCAN"
msgstr "通过DroneCAN传递串行数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:7
#: 87fbe8320abe45d8b00924f2c939932d
msgid ""
"It is possible to pass serial communications from programs such as Ublox GPS"
" U-Center over DroneCAN to the peripheral. This allows configuring and "
"firmware updating internal serially connected peripherals sitting behind a "
"DroneCAN interface, such as GPS modules."
msgstr ""
"可以通过DroneCAN将来自Ublox GPS "
"U-Center等程序的串行通信传递给外设。这允许在不从飞控断开连接的情况下，通过USB连接对位于DroneCAN接口后面的内部串行连接外设（如GPS模块）进行配置和固件更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:9
#: 050025b0d2b0410282e630943c46267d
msgid ""
"The DroneCAN peripheral must be running AP_Periph firmware revision 1.5.1 or"
" later and the DroneCAN GUI tool version 1.2.22 or later"
msgstr "DroneCAN外设必须运行AP_Periph固件版本1.5.1或更高版本，DroneCAN GUI工具版本1.2.22或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:11
#: 44d8a3e9bc924dbda7cfd5268891cdb3
msgid ""
"This is accomplished using the latest version of the `DroneCAN GUI tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/CAN_GUI/>`__ :"
msgstr ""
"使用最新版本的 `DroneCAN GUI工具 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/CAN_GUI/>`__ "
"完成此操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:13
#: b55a80dc2af548cbb97bc76c439d0506
msgid ""
"Connect the autopilot with its target DroneCAN peripheral to your PC. Do not"
" start a local ground station like Mission Planner."
msgstr "将飞控及其目标DroneCAN外设连接到PC。不要启动本地地面站（如Mission Planner）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:14
#: 469e33511d58468691af9bcc08bf320a
msgid ""
"Start the DroneCAN GUI tool over MAVlink to the autopilot and click the "
"local node ID checkmark"
msgstr "通过MAVLink将DroneCAN GUI工具连接到飞控，并勾选本地节点ID复选框。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:19
#: 58e1f69f1bce494c83c6b7bbdf9aa540
msgid ""
"Click Panels->Serial Forwarding and select the peripheral node to forward "
"from"
msgstr "点击Panels->Serial Forwarding，选择要从中转发的外设节点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:24
#: 20036045438e4b88821be9c10264a833
msgid ""
"Start U-Center or other appropriate tool and connect to the local host using"
" port 2001, ie 127.0.0.1:2001 from its Receiver->Connection->Network "
"Connection menu. You may have to create it as a NEW connection first."
msgstr ""
"启动U-Center或其他适当工具，通过其Receiver->Connection->Network "
"Connection菜单连接到本地主机的2001端口，即127.0.0.1:2001。您可能需要先创建一个新连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:29
#: 7f8c196146cc4aa4bf31e99cc73d10a3
msgid ""
"You will now be connected to the application and the State in the Serial "
"Forwarding dialog will change to show the connection. You can examine the "
"DroneCAN module's data flow, check its firmware revision, make configuration"
" changes, etc. Whatever you could do if the module was directly connected to"
" the PCs serial port using U-Center or other application."
msgstr ""
"您现在将连接到该应用程序，串行转发对话框中的State将变化以显示连接状态。您可以查看DroneCAN模块的数据流、检查其固件版本、进行配置更改等，就像模块直接通过U-"
"Center或其他应用程序连接到PC串行端口时能做的一切。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:31
#: 7f905cd8499b43df91aa204592af2700
msgid ""
"In order to change configuration of the DroneCAN's peripheral module "
"(GPS,etc.) over this link you will need to change \"UART Locking\" in the "
"Serial Forwarding dialog to \"Locked\". This gives the connected program "
"exclusive access to the module to allow changes to be made without the "
"DroneCAN peripheral's microcontroller overwriting them. This is required to "
"make permanent configuration changes and for firmware upgrading."
msgstr ""
"为了通过此链接更改DroneCAN外设模块（GPS等）的配置，需要将串行转发对话框中的「UART "
"Locking」更改为「Locked」。这将为已连接的程序提供对模块的独占访问权限，允许在DroneCAN外设的微控制器不会覆盖的情况下进行更改。这是进行永久配置更改和固件升级所必需的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:33
#: beaf361379704abfa55fb3270b30c483
msgid ""
"be aware that configuration changes you make may still be overwritten when "
"rebooting the DroneCAN peripheral. For example, some GPS configuration items"
" are changed at initialization of a GPS unless the "
":ref:`GPS_AUTO_CONFIG<GPS_AUTO_CONFIG>` is disabled, but those not auto "
"configured would remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"请注意，重启DroneCAN外设时，您所做的配置更改可能仍会被覆盖。例如，除非禁用 "
":ref:`GPS_AUTO_CONFIG<GPS_AUTO_CONFIG>`，否则某些GPS配置项会在GPS初始化时被更改，但未自动配置的项目将保持不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:36
#: 6bcb062c34ad4c689f783784b3dc79dd
msgid "Firmware Update"
msgstr "固件更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:38
#: 7c4fad656f774420a3e4b62d9e339bdb
msgid ""
"this has only been tested on Ublox F9P based devices as of this writing."
msgstr "截至本文撰写时，此功能仅在基于Ublox F9P的设备上测试过。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:40
#: 3e1792a10b73451e9ca4546a8b379fd0
msgid ""
"While in the above connected state, you can also update the internal "
"module's firmware, if available and if the module normally allows this when "
"connected as a standalone module, outside of the DroneCAN peripheral."
msgstr "在上述已连接状态下，如果固件可用且该模块在独立连接时通常允许此操作，您还可以更新内部模块的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:42
#: 402e05c148fc4b71a029a88100b390b0
msgid ""
"For UBlox F9P GPSs, you will need to change the modules baud rate from "
"230.4KBaud down to 56.7Kbaud using the Config-> PRT configuration:"
msgstr "对于UBlox F9P GPS，您需要使用Config->PRT配置将模块波特率从230.4KBaud降至56.7Kbaud："

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:44
#: 832d4c3a18f04c01a8fa145bc99cc4e6
msgid ""
"Check the uBlox message handling checkbox in the Serial Forwarding dialog "
"box. This will watch for the baud rate change you will be making and change "
"the DroneCAN's serial port baud rate to match so communication can continue."
msgstr ""
"勾选串行转发对话框中的uBlox消息处理复选框。这将监视您即将进行的波特率更改，并自动将DroneCAN的串行端口波特率更改为相匹配，以保持通信继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:45
#: 030aca47c5f645eaa714450a0fa13cd5
msgid ""
"Select View->Configuration->PRT and change the baud to 57.6K and click the "
"send button."
msgstr "选择View->Configuration->PRT，将波特率改为57.6K并点击发送按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:50
#: 96aa96dda40a4e3d85cd2e091486705a
msgid ""
"Verify that communication is still occurring by seeing the RX bytes number "
"change in the Serial Forwarding dialog box. If not repeat the about PRT "
"change."
msgstr "通过查看串行转发对话框中RX字节数的变化来验证通信是否仍在进行。如果不是，请重复上述PRT更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-over-DroneCAN.rst:51
#: d81ac8a59f854265a8c370fb08d44a0c
msgid ""
"Then using U-Center's Tools menu, select the Firmware update and select the "
"firmware image file and set the baud rate to 56.7Kbaud. Click GO button at "
"the bottom  to start the update."
msgstr "然后使用U-Center的Tools菜单，选择固件更新，选择固件镜像文件并将波特率设置为56.7Kbaud。点击底部的GO按钮开始更新。"

